# My Skills

Personal collection of dev skills for [Codex (OpenAI)](https://github.com/openai/codex) and [Claude Code (Anthropic)](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code), distilled from daily practice.

All skills follow统一命名规范，详见 [NAMING.md](./NAMING.md)。

## Skills

| Skill | 分类 | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [ko-cq-review](./ko-cq-review/) | Code Quality | 多视角、五维代码审查，结合独立上下文、证据分级、依赖检查与修复验证 |
| [ko-cq-agent-guidelines](./ko-cq-agent-guidelines/) | Code Quality | Coding agent 的顶层行为准则：理解任务、控制改动范围、验证结果并清晰沟通 |
| [ko-sd-architect](./ko-sd-architect/) | System Design | 基于领域与证据的架构决策与设计输出规范：约束、契约、架构视图、质量场景和集成验收 |
| [ko-dx-rca](./ko-dx-rca/) | Developer Experience | 根因分析 (5-Why methodology) |
| [ko-dx-maple-observe](./ko-dx-maple-observe/) | Developer Experience | 使用已运行的 Maple Local 通过 logs、traces、metrics 定位本地服务 bug 与性能问题 |
| [ko-dx-linux-verify](./ko-dx-linux-verify/) | Developer Experience | 在 macOS 上用本地 smolvm 验证 Linux-only 行为、CI、容器和 Kubernetes 场景 |
| [ko-kb-html](./ko-kb-html/) | Knowledge Base | 为 plan、architecture、PRD、prototype、review、research、report 等长文档生成自包含 HTML companion |
| [ko-kb-site-docs](./ko-kb-site-docs/) | Knowledge Base | 生成或重构项目文档站点，包括信息架构、导航、页面层级、参考文档和发布验证 |
| [ko-sd-project-harness](./ko-sd-project-harness/) | System Design | 初始化 startup 空项目，或先规划已有项目的 AI-native 工程化结构、布局、约束和验证回路 |

## Usage

### Claude Code

```bash
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-cq-review
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-cq-agent-guidelines
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-sd-architect
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-dx-rca
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-dx-linux-verify
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-kb-html
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-kb-site-docs
claude mcp add-skill /path/to/myskills/ko-sd-project-harness
```

### Codex

Copy the skill's `SKILL.md` content into your Codex agent instructions or reference it via project config.

For session-wide coding guidelines, make `ko-cq-agent-guidelines` available to the agent and add this to the project's or user's agent instructions (for example, `AGENTS.md` or `CLAUDE.md`):

```markdown
At session start, read and apply ko-cq-agent-guidelines/SKILL.md from its installed location. Preserve its active preference and task state across turns and handoffs, subject to the host's instruction hierarchy and my explicit changes or exit request.
```

Use the actual installed path if needed. A skill description enables discovery; the instruction above requests loading at session start and does not change system-level priority.

For always-on HTML companions, add this global agent instruction after installing or copying `ko-kb-html`:

```markdown
When you produce a substantial Markdown document such as a plan, architecture doc, PRD, prototype spec, review, research note, report, postmortem, or implementation brief, use `ko-kb-html` to create a self-contained `.html` companion when the document has enough structure to benefit from layout, navigation, diagrams, comparison, or interaction, unless the user explicitly asks for Markdown only.
```

## Creating a New Skill

```bash
# 1. 创建目录（必须遵循 ko-{分类}-{功能} 格式）
mkdir ko-dx-newskill

# 2. 从模板创建 SKILL.md
cp SKILL_TEMPLATE.md ko-dx-newskill/SKILL.md

# 3. 编辑 SKILL.md，确保 name 与目录名一致
```

命名规则详见 [NAMING.md](./NAMING.md)。

